From 2b2e54a67ee0f2635aaacd4951a5b6a10a3d261a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rams95 <rams95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:24:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0020-crisp-copies-bar-opacity-banks-card-skip.patch

Crisp picture at any internal resolution: Raw Danger copies each finished picture into the shown buffer at 449 rows from
448, which the engine read with the console's one-texel tent (a blur of about one console pixel at every scale);
PS2_RT_COPY_TENT=0 reads near 1:1 copies of a rendered picture by their own inner samples (gs.wgsl RT_TENT). Cutscene
black bars by opacity 0-100 (keys.ini black_bars), the subtitles' halo fading with them; the lens mist no longer stops at
the HUD boxes (the dark box behind subtitles). The card check at start is run unseen at full speed (PS2_SKIP_SCENE).
A second disc remap per option (remap2_off/on: the Enhanced Edition's sound banks with voices follow the voice switch).
F7 retries until the game switches and opens only from the scene given (PS2_DEBUG_SCENES 4th number). Sharpen off by
default; menu footer gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
